'''Kelnacca's shelter'''<ref name="Revenge/Justice Guide">{{SW|url=series/the-acolyte/revenge-justice-episode-guide|text="Revenge / Justice" Episode Guide &#124; The Acolyte}}</ref> was the wreckage of a [[starship]] embedded in the roots of a large [[tree]] on [[Khofar]] that was used as a shelter by [[Kelnacca]], a [[Wookiee]]<ref name="Acolyte EP2" /> [[Jedi Master]].<ref name="Showcase">{{SW|url=news/swce-2023-lucasfilm-studio-showcase|text=SWCE 2023: 11 Highlights from Lucasfilm's Studio Showcase|author=[[Dan Brooks|Brooks, Dan]]|date=2023-04-08}}</ref> A sign on the shelter read "Keep Out" in [[Shyriiwook]].<ref name="Revenge/Justice Guide" />

{{Struct-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Kelnacca's shelter first appeared in "[[Revenge / Justice]]," the second episode of the [[2024]] [[Disney+]] live-action series ''[[Star Wars: The Acolyte]]''.<ref name="Acolyte EP2" />

